WEBVTT

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.140
Copies of notes...

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.490
Last year's questions
with all the answers....

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.960
And the exam schedule.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:54.790
Thanks, Sakamoto.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:56.550
I appreciate all this.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:59.470
I barely have enough credits.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.930
If I fail even one class
I'm in deep trouble next year.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:08.040
Well, that's what I figured.
Thought I'd better help you out.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:08.870
Godai?

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:09.570
Yes?

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:12.410
Um...

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.310
I brought you some coffee.

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:18.500
-Thank you.
-Thanks very much!

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.120
So...

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:24.750
Are you ready for your exams?

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:28.850
-I guess...
-Things look pretty bleak for him.

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:32.820
He has a bad attendance record
'cause of his broken leg fiasco.

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:37.160
He might fail
two required classes.

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:38.950
When it comes
to required courses...

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.190
it's all about
attendance, you know.

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:45.160
I see.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:47.000
Attendance.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:53.750
I-I skipped a lot of classes
to work part time.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.170
Yes, but...

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.820
Don't worry.
If I just pass all my exams--

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.120
But you know how
he's not the brightest dude.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.120
If he fails even one exam, he'll surely
have to repeat this school year.

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:04.980
Repeat this year?

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.280
S-Sakamoto! You...

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:30.290
Sakamoto, please help Godai.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.030
Sure. I'm a good guy.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.510
I answered roll calls
for him, gave him my notes...

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.440
Thank you very much.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.940
You don't need to
thank him for me, Manager.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.400
Well, I won't take up
any more of your time.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.410
Manager...

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.910
See you!
Thank you for the coffee!

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:01.150
Why, you...! Blabbermouth!

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.670
Well, I guess I'm outta here.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.090
What's with the hand?

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:14.060
You don't think all this
friendship comes free, do you?

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:34.450
IF Godai' has to repeat this year,
it's all my fault.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.720
It's my fault he broke his leg.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.960
He tried to save me.

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:55.640
What are you doing, Young Godai?

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.860
He's got finals!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:05.520
It's no use cramming now.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:11.350
Drink up!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.720
Forget about finals!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.540
Forget finals,
and then what?

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:19.990
We want you to remain
a student forever.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:23.400
It's cold!
Cuddle with me, Godai.

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:28.900
You people...

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:30.640
CUT IT OUT!

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.180
What's gotten into you, Manager?

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.850
Everyone, please come with me.

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:48.390
For what?

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:51.330
Dinner, perhaps?

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.890
Just come with me!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:54.530
All right.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.510
Godai, you don't have to come.

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:06.930
Go back to studying.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.360
Leave everything else to me.

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:19.420
Study hard, all right?

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:27.390
Manager...

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.100
What's goin' on?

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:56.810
Do you people have any idea
what Godai is facing?

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.790
Finals, right?

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.990
He's repeating this
school year, right?

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:06.030
That's not definite!

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:07.550
ANYWAY...

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:12.540
during finals, you are
NOT to party in Godai's room!

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:13.870
PERIOD!

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:16.020
-What?!
-No way!

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:18.540
-What gives you the right?
-That's cruel!

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:20.910
-You're crazy!
-What kinda rule is that?!

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.220
She's serious.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:35.350
He's not gonna pass,
no matter what.

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:44.010
Too late, too late
Gone are the days
Never to return

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.100
Too many syllables...

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:21.800
It's unsettling when it's too quiet.

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:40.360
Godai?

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:41.530
Y-Yes!

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:45.550
I brought you a snack.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:59.280
How's your studying going?
All right?

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.410
Uh... Fine.

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:02.760
Great.

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:05.860
I know I'm being a meddler...

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.520
but I'd like to make
all your meals during your finals.

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.520
M-Manager...

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:22.270
Godai, you just concentrate
on your studies.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.070
Be quiet!

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:35.210
-Why?
-We're not in Godai's room.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.050
He can hear you.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.680
-Fine. We'll go to Yotsuya's room.
-It makes no difference!

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:44.230
What's gotten into the manager?

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:49.790
She must feel guilty
about my broken leg.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:55.860
Is that why she's taking
such good care of me?

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:15.520
Stingy.

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.420
Please get out. You're
interrupting my studies.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:23.790
If you eat too much, you're
going to become even dumber.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:48.390
I'm off!

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.230
Good luck!

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:06.540
Even with the manager's support...

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.710
...it's not like
I instantly grew smarter.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.030
How did it go, Godai?

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:25.920
I think I did okay.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:30.270
The other tenants
didn't bother me.

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:34.950
The manager kicked you out?

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:38.250
She said to go out
if we want to party.

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:40.170
It's so unfair!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:44.150
That's right.
She's only nice to Godai.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:46.610
I don't like it one bit!

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:51.050
It's not the same without
our pal Godai.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:56.790
Ten days have passed
without incident.

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:49.450
Yes?

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:53.880
Here you go.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.370
Thank you.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.560
Tomorrow's the last day, isn't it?

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.810
Only the Adolescent Psych exam left.

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.630
What time does it start?

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.170
Let's see...

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.400
at 8:50 AM.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.450
That's early. Can you get up?

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.350
I think so.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.690
Shall I wake you up?

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:19.820
I-I couldn't possibly ask you to...

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:24.690
I'd be happy to!
You've been studying so hard.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:28.070
It'd be a shame
if you got there late.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:31.790
Well, if you don't mind, please.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:13:59.560
Cheers!

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.660
Manager! Hope you
don't mind us here.

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:08.610
You weren't drinking
at Chachamaru?

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:11.710
It's too expensive to drink out.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:16.170
Since you won't
let us party upstairs...

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:19.350
...we have no choice
but to do it here.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.040
Can't be helped, I guess.

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:27.620
You have a glass, too, Manager.

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:30.290
All right. Just one glass.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.750
Let's party!

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:34.730
Yes! Let's!

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:04.890
Uh... Shall we call it a night?

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:08.250
What? We're just gettin' started!

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:10.660
Yeah, yeah, yeah...

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:14.100
But, I have to wake up Godai
in the morning.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:18.240
Did ya hear that?
No fair! No fair!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:22.440
You'll wake up Godai,
but you won't stay up with us?

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.910
What are you talking about?

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.280
Ladies!

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:32.540
More drinks and snacks for all!

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.380
Here you go!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.060
Yeah!

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:37.420
It's 'bout time!

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:58.110
2:00 AM.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.320
Maybe I'll get some sleep now.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:07.360
No! Since the manager's
gonna wake me up...

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:08.960
I'll study a little longer.

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:21.290
Let's dedicate
a drinking song to Godai!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.030
Ready, and...

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:28.610
In January, he broke his leg
So we'll drink to that for him

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:33.540
So we'll drink to that for him
So we'll drink to that for him

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:38.580
In February, he's gotta study
So we'll drink to that for him

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:43.190
So we'll drink to that for him
So we'll drink to that for him

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:48.020
In March, he's got his finals
So we'll drink to that for him

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:53.250
So we'll drink to that for him
So we'll drink to that for him

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:58.000
In April, he finds out he's failed
So we'll drink to that for him...

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:48.830
GODAI!!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:55.770
Wake up! Godai, get up!

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.330
All right. I'm up.

00:17:58.610 --> 00:17:59.870
Hurry! Get ready!

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.040
I'll call a cab right now!

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:11.470
Got everything?

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:12.020
Yes!

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:35.100
Please! Hurry!

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:38.540
Well... It's rush hour, y'know.

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:49.710
I'm sorry, Godai. I'm sorry.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.980
Please...don't apologize.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.500
I can't believe...

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.920
There's still hope.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:05.130
We're allowed to be
a half hour late at our school.

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:09.040
As long as I'm there by 9:20...

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:26.330
Please... Can't he...?

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.320
Come back next year.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:30.590
Please! Couldn't you...?

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:36.150
Manager, let's go.
It's no use.

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:38.630
But...but...

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:02.620
Don't cry.

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:05.390
It's not your fault.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:09.150
It is! It's all my fault!

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:12.160
Your broken leg,
the exam you missed...

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.670
your having to repeat
this school year...

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.800
I might not have to
repeat this year...

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:18.010
Yes you do! I know it!

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.050
Even if I failed one class
if I try really hard next year'...

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:26.640
You might not have passed
all your finals!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:30.350
If you've failed three or four,
you'll never make them all up!

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.090
Don't be so pessimistic.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.180
I'm sure I'm right.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:38.000
I'm sure. I know it.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:42.800
You couldn't study at all
while you were in the hospital!

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:47.730
Even if I weren't in the hospital,
I wouldn't have studied anyway.

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:51.040
I've messed up your life!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.010
I know!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.140
Don't be so sad, Manager!

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.320
I can take a makeup exam.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.520
There's no makeup exam
for Adolescent Psych.

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.380
Really?
I'm glad I didn't take it.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.150
I'm flunking...?

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:22.760
Reality is finally sinking in.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:28.630
I guess it's one more year for me.
This doesn't make me look cool.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:29.430
No.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.940
I guess I won't
be graduating soon.

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:44.370
Godai...

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:50.000
I...

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.540
I can wait a year.

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:56.960
I...

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:08.940
Hey, Godai! Whatcha doin' here?

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:09.670
Sakamoto...

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.250
Hey! Manager!

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:13.640
You came with him?

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:14.820
No, I...

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:17.260
Let's go, Godai.

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:18.370
Go where?

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:21.980
You know
the Adolescent Psych exam's next.

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:25.360
B-But...

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:27.530
it says here...

00:22:27.850 --> 00:22:28.700
What?

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:32.510
Oops! Wrote it down wrong! Sorry!

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:37.370
Wrote it down wrong?! Why you--!

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:40.670
But, you were here in school,
weren't you?

00:22:41.090 --> 00:22:42.780
You shoulda
double-checked yourself.

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:52.600
Manager! I'm sorry.

00:23:08.760 --> 00:23:11.120
Final exams were soon over...

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:14.470
and I somehow got away without
having to repeat this school year.

00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:19.090
But...

00:23:20.770 --> 00:23:22.290
I can wait a year.

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:24.380
I...

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:28.390
What was Kyoko going
to say after that?

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:44.130
I guess I'll never know.

00:23:49.640 --> 00:23:51.330
Will it be Godai, or Mitaka?

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:53.870
The two rivals clash
in the race for love.

00:23:53.970 --> 00:23:55.690
Everything rides on
the edge of the blade!

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:58.500
A heroic battle
is about to be fought!

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:02.640
Next: "The Kyoko Invitational!
The Skating-Rink is Love's Battlefield"

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:06.470
Come on! If you don't get up,
Yotsuya will be back!
